<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sir John returns with a week of home readings, taken morning and evening with a validated upper-arm monitor and a large cuff: the average of 28 readings is 144/90, with no reading below 132/84. He has cut his wine to one glass with dinner and his salt, and walks every day. He has no headaches, chest pain, breathlessness, palpitations or ankle swelling. He brought no urine sample to the intake visit and has not yet given one. The tuberculosis blood test drawn at intake is negative. He is seen this afternoon by Dr. Okafor-Lindqvist of wilderness and expedition medicine. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home readings</td><td>Seven-day average 144/90 mmHg (28 readings)</td></tr><tr><td>Office reading</td><td>148/92 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>One glass of wine with dinner; less salt; daily walks</td></tr><tr><td>Tuberculosis blood test</td><td>Negative</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

